From 724d7550ac74be21dbd24086c8a8ee8f70368514 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dev <dev@example.local>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:20:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Add reusable copy to clipboard button component

Add a ds-copy-to-clipboard component that copies its content to the
user's clipboard. It uses the asynchronous Clipboard API when available
and falls back to document.execCommand('copy') for older browsers and
non-secure contexts.

After a successful copy the button's tooltip briefly reads "Copied!"
(also announced to screen readers through a live region). When the
clipboard can't be accessed an error notification is shown instead.

The component is declared and exported by the SharedModule.
